{"synopsis":"**Dari Artist yang mengerjakan *Noblesse!***\n\nArchimond, Sang Necromancer Terkuat yang Pernah Menebar Teror di Seluruh Benua.\n\nNyawanya melayang di ujung pedang sang pahlawan, Berkel Reinland.\n\nDan 200 tahun kemudian... ia terlahir kembali sebagai bayi dari sebuah keluarga bangsawan.\n\nKata-kata pertama yang terucap dari bibirnya:\n\n**\"Wahai para penjaga kegelapan, para kaki tangan, dan seluruh pasukanku... taatilah perintahku!\"**","alternative_title":"검술명가의 네크로맨서","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"ch_21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"af203802-7ebd-4350-9453-e0d55cc4590a","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"2915a283-2808-49d2-b1aa-373d85d5781c","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-07-24"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"58a35062-5992-429d-b0b1-8802fd921fba","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"d7564841-ff1c-438c-af93-23257a3c932d","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-07-10"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"9ea6068b-32ef-4637-9141-10f122005c38","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-07-04"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"afd1d824-c72d-4273-a0b3-5780716e95ea","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"14","chapter":"14","slug":"63c43ccc-5421-4de6-b67b-7a8d36690e5a","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-06-19"},{"number":"13","chapter":"13","slug":"1b89c0da-204f-4240-b0e3-df20c8fbe2c4","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"12","chapter":"12","slug":"eb9f63f5-2b42-4bfa-a3e5-345409873f28","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-06-05"},{"number":"11","chapter":"11","slug":"aefa8428-9977-4472-a92d-0674a389115f","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-05-29"},{"number":"10","chapter":"10","slug":"3c6e363b-8b0e-4204-b42a-acd75980e272","title":"Chapter 10","date":"2026-05-28"},{"number":"9","chapter":"9","slug":"eaa031b5-8658-4031-9508-5c1388c453